@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 创建考试；短答题答案稍后留空，因此本验收文件不会调用 DeepSeek
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "第二阶段持久化验收",
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionNo": 1,
      "questionType": "CHOICE",
      "content": "HTTP 默认端口是哪一个？",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "referenceAnswer": "80"
    },
    {
      "questionNo": 2,
      "questionType": "SHORT_ANSWER",
      "content": "简述 TCP 的可靠传输机制。",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "referenceAnswer": "序号、确认、重传等机制。",
      "rubricItems": [
        {
          "itemOrder": 1,
          "name": "说明至少一种可靠传输机制",
          "maxScore": 5
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("examId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("choiceQuestionId", response.body.questions[0].id);
  client.global.set("shortQuestionId", response.body.questions[1].id);
%}

### 2. 提交结构化答案；空字符串明确表示短答题未作答，不会发起 AI 请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams/{{examId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNo": "20260001",
  "studentName": "持久化验收学生",
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": {{choiceQuestionId}},
      "answerText": "80"
    },
    {
      "questionId": {{shortQuestionId}},
      "answerText": ""
    }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("submissionId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. 自动评分并保存；预期两题 SUCCESS、actualScore 均为 null
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grading

### 4. 查询数据库中的评分结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/results

### 5. 重启应用后再次执行本请求；结果应仍然存在
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/results
